  "evidence": "Authored teaching deformation",
  "scope": "Authored respiratory motion. The diaphragm itself deforms, the ribs rotate on posterior pivots, and intercostal geometry follows the nearest ribs. Abdominal-wall changes are teaching approximations. Regional intercostal recruitment, organ deformation, pressure, and individual forces are not simulated.",
  "components": [
